{"slug":"quickstart","route":"/docs/quickstart","title":"快速上手","eyebrow":"开始","description":"不注册、不带密钥，一分钟发出第一个 NextMoe API v2 请求：读懂响应、按需取块、用外部 id 反查；量大了再自助铸密钥。","toc":[{"id":"first-call","text":"1 · 发出第一个请求","depth":2},{"id":"include","text":"2 · 按需取块","depth":2},{"id":"refs","text":"3 · 手里已经有外部 id？","depth":2},{"id":"key","text":"4 · 量大了：铸一把密钥","depth":2},{"id":"app","text":"创建应用","depth":3},{"id":"mint","text":"铸造并带上密钥","depth":3},{"id":"next","text":"接下来","depth":2}],"html":"<h1 id=\"快速上手\">快速上手</h1>\n<p>读目录不需要注册，也不需要密钥。整个 <code>/v2/catalog</code> 只读面（<code>claim-events</code> 除外）以及 <code>/v2/news</code>、<code>/v2/vocabularies</code>、<code>/v2/problems</code> 都可以什么凭据都不带，复制下面的命令就能跑。</p>\n<p>不带凭据的请求按来源 IP 计一份额度，默认每分钟 30 次、每天 1,000 次，个人脚本、浏览器扩展和本地工具都够用。量上来了再<a href=\"#key\">铸一把密钥</a>，同样不需要申请。</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-call\">1 · 发出第一个请求</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/works?limit=3\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>响应体<strong>就是</strong>那个集合，没有 <code>{code,message,data}</code> 外壳：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"work\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"galgame\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"display_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Summer Pockets REFLECTION BLUE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"latin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"localized\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"olang\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"content_rating\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all_ages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"content_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sfw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"release_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2018-04-25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"release_date_precision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"release_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"released\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"width\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"height\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"thumbhash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sexual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"violence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cover\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"banner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"claim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kungal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"site_work_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"live\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"content_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sfw\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-06T10:45:35Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"updated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-11T11:26:58Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"next_cursor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cur_…\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>object</code> 是类型判别符，每个资源都带，值就是它的族名。</li>\n<li>id 是<strong>十进制字符串</strong>。它在库里是 int64，超出 JavaScript <code>Number</code> 的安全整数范围，发成 JSON number 会静默失真。</li>\n<li>翻页只有 <code>next_cursor</code> 一种：把它原样回传即可。<strong>末页直接不出现这个键</strong>，没有 <code>has_more</code>，也不要用 <code>items.length === limit</code> 判断还有没有下一页。</li>\n<li>默认瘦身：集合里的 <code>localized{}</code> 要带 <code>include=titles</code> 才会填上；作品的标签、角色、评分、封面列表这些块也都要在 <code>include=</code> 里点名才会出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>浏览器里同样能直接调：CORS 对所有来源开放，<code>fetch(&quot;https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/works?limit=3&quot;)</code> 就行，不需要自己的后端代理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"include\">2 · 按需取块</h2>\n<p>详情面同理——默认只有身份内核，<code>include=</code> 决定要哪些块，写错 token 是 <code>400 UNKNOWN_INCLUDE</code> 而不是静默少块：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/works/12?include=tags,ratings,companies\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>每个族有哪些 <code>include</code> token、哪些 <code>sort</code> 键、哪些顶层字段，都能从发现面自己问出来，不必翻文档：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/schemas/work\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"refs\">3 · 手里已经有外部 id？</h2>\n<p>不用先搜再猜。反查是集合上的一个参数，一次最多 100 个 <code>source:external_id</code>，没锚到的原样回在 <code>missing[]</code> 里，而不是让整个请求 404：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/works?refs=steam:1230140,dlsite:VJ014002,bangumi:297264\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>这三个 id 来自三家不同的站点，指的是同一部作品，所以只回一条记录。要知道每条结果是哪个 id 命中的，带上 <code>include=refs</code>；要连 R18 作品一起匹配，带上 <code>nsfw=true</code>——不带的话，R18 作品会和真正没收录的作品一起落进 <code>missing[]</code>。匿名请求同样可以带 <code>nsfw=true</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"key\">4 · 量大了：铸一把密钥</h2>\n<p>匿名额度刻意定得很小，它够一个人用，但撑不起一个产品。遇到下面任何一种情况，就该带凭据了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从自己的服务端调用。</strong> 服务器只有一个出口 IP，不带凭据时你的全部用户会挤进同一份匿名额度。</li>\n<li><strong>每天超过 1,000 次</strong>，或者需要每分钟 30 次以上的突发。</li>\n<li>要用 <code>/v2/store</code>、<a href=\"/docs/moyu-patches\"><code>/v2/moyu/*</code></a>、<a href=\"/docs/sticker-packs\"><code>/v2/sticker/*</code></a> 这几个只收密钥的面。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"app\">创建应用</h3>\n<p>用生态账号（NextMoe / 鲲 Galgame）登录 <a href=\"/dashboard\">控制台</a>，不必另外注册开发者身份。每个账号最多 5 个应用，每个应用最多 5 把在用密钥。应用是配额、用量与 scope 的边界——一个产品一个应用，出事时可以单独吊销。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mint\">铸造并带上密钥</h3>\n<p>密钥形如 <code>nmk_live_…</code>，尾部带 CRC32 校验位，<strong>只在铸造时显示一次</strong>。它是机密：只放服务端，不要写进前端包、移动端二进制或公开仓库。开发联调可以铸 <code>nmk_test_</code> 前缀的测试密钥。自助铸的密钥是 <code>free</code> 档，每分钟 60 次、每天 50,000 次，见<a href=\"/docs/rate-limits\">限流与配额</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://api.nextmoe.dev/v2/catalog/works?limit=3\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer nmk_live_&#x3C;YOUR_KEY>\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>返回的数据和匿名请求逐字节相同，只是额度记在你的应用上。</p>\n<p>自助可勾选的 scope 有两个——<code>catalog:read</code>（读目录数据）与 <code>store:read</code>（<a href=\"/docs/store\">DLsite 分销链接</a>）。<a href=\"/docs/moyu-patches\"><code>/v2/moyu/*</code></a>、<a href=\"/docs/sticker-packs\"><code>/v2/sticker/*</code></a> 与 <a href=\"/docs/letmoe\"><code>/v2/letmoe/*</code></a> 三个下游面不需要任何 scope，任意有效密钥都能调（两条 <code>/file</code> 下载路由除外，要运营发放的 <code>moyu:files</code> / <code>letmoe:files</code>）。<code>claim_events:read</code> 由运营方按需授予，不能自助勾选。</p>\n<p>分发出去的桌面客户端没有服务端可放密钥：要么继续匿名（每个用户各自按自己的 IP 计额度），要么改用用户访问令牌——见<a href=\"/docs/native-app\">原生桌面应用接入</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"next\">接下来</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/authentication\">鉴权与凭据</a> — 不带凭据、应用密钥、用户访问令牌，各自能开哪些面。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/concepts\">数据模型</a> — 六源如何对齐成一条记录，实体族之间怎么连。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/example\">全链走查</a> — 用两个真实系列走通搜索 → 详情 → 厂牌 → 反查。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/v2\">端点参考</a> — 每个端点的参数、响应与 curl 示例。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/moyu-patches\">下游站点面</a> — 补丁与表情包两个联邦面：任意有效密钥，不需要任何 scope。</li>\n</ul>\n"}